Modifications made by this fork
-------------------------------

1. Added a runtime Chinese translation layer:
     app/src/main/java/com/opendroid/ai/i18n/I18n.kt      (tr() + assets/i18n/zh.json)
     app/src/main/java/com/opendroid/ai/i18n/AppText.kt  (render-time translation wrapper)

2. Routed user-visible UI strings through that layer:
     - literals wrapped in tr(...)                        (tools/apply_i18n.py)
     - Compose Text(...) calls renamed to AppText(...)    (tools/apply_i18n.py)
     - interpolated strings translated in place           (tools/apply_templates.py)
     - Application startup wiring                         (tools/apply_bootstrap.py)

3. Translated user-visible text into Simplified Chinese:
     - UI labels, buttons, dialogs, errors, notifications, accessibility text
     - long-form content (privacy policy, terms of use, help center)
     - the app display name is now "OpenDroid 中文版"

4. Added tooling for reproducible localization and upstream synchronization:
     tools/localize.sh, tools/sync-upstream.sh, tools/build_worksheet.py,
     tools/merge_translations.py

Files modified by the localization pipeline carry a prominent notice:
     // Modified by opendroid-cn (Chinese localization fork): ...


